# ALLOWLIST - read this before editing.
#
# This tree is mostly business data: ~1,600 spreadsheets, sell-out CSV exports,
# photos, HAR captures holding live session cookies, plus unrelated projects.
# So: ignore EVERYTHING, then opt specific code back in, one level at a time.
# Never flip this to a blocklist - one missed pattern publishes a sales export
# or a cookie jar. Git cannot re-include a file under an excluded directory,
# which is why each directory level is re-opened explicitly below.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# --- Automation: every pipeline + the monitoring tools ----------------------
!/Automation/
/Automation/**
!/Automation/*/
!/Automation/*.ps1
!/Automation/*/*.py
!/Automation/*/*.ps1
!/Automation/*/*.md
!/Automation/*/requirements.txt
!/Automation/*/.env.example
# scratch watcher from a one-off debugging session
/Automation/_*.ps1

# --- Data/Sent Email: the Alfamart/Alfamidi B2B pipeline only ---------------
# (the rest of this folder is other projects and exported data)
!/Data/
/Data/*
!/Data/Sent Email/
/Data/Sent Email/*
!/Data/Sent Email/alfamart_b2b_auto.py
!/Data/Sent Email/alfamidi_b2b_auto.py
!/Data/Sent Email/imap_b2b_download.py
!/Data/Sent Email/period_utils.py
!/Data/Sent Email/run_pipeline.py
!/Data/Sent Email/run_daily_all.py
!/Data/Sent Email/run_backfill_today.py
!/Data/Sent Email/register_b2b_schedule.ps1

# --- per-brand processing steps (1_/2_/3_*.py) that live beside the data -----
!/Data/Report/
/Data/Report/*
!/Data/Report/Sales/
/Data/Report/Sales/*
!/Data/Report/Sales/Minimarket/
/Data/Report/Sales/Minimarket/*
!/Data/Report/Sales/Minimarket/*/
/Data/Report/Sales/Minimarket/*/*
!/Data/Report/Sales/Minimarket/*/*/
/Data/Report/Sales/Minimarket/*/*/*
!/Data/Report/Sales/Minimarket/*/*/[0-9]_*.py

# --- belt and braces: never, even if a rule above is loosened ---------------
.env
*.log
*.har
client_secret_*.json
token*.json
*.pickle
.venv/
__pycache__/
graphify-out/
